# 
# http://w3id.org/trajecto#CentralityRole
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#CentralityRole> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#CentralityRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#Abstract> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#CentralityRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Structural role of a POI in the graphs of co-visitation and flow between POIs, derived from its degree, betweenness and PageRank relative to the other POIs."@en .
