# http://w3id.org/trajecto#CulturalEvent
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#CulturalEvent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#CulturalEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://w3id.org/trajecto#EventOfInterest> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#CulturalEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An event of interest of a cultural nature, such as a festival or an exhibition opening."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#CulturalEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/trajecto> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#CulturalEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Cultural Event"@en .
# 
# http://w3id.org/trajecto#EngagementLevel
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EngagementLevel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EngagementLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Engagement of a trajectory as a whole, derived from the share of its meaningful and immersive interactions. Values: HighEngagement, MediumEngagement, LowEngagement. The temporal-dwell module models engagement of single dwell events separately."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EngagementLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/trajecto> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EngagementLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Engagement Level"@en .
# 
# http://w3id.org/trajecto#EntityOfInterest
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EntityOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EntityOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#Entity> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EntityOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:genid1 .
_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://w3id.org/trajecto#hasInterest> .
_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EntityOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The entity of interest of any kind (object, event, living organism), that the recording activity aims to record."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EntityOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/trajecto> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EntityOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Entity of Interest"@en .
# 
# http://w3id.org/trajecto#EventOfInterest
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EventOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EventOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://w3id.org/trajecto#EntityOfInterest> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EventOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.datacron-project.eu/datAcron#Event> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EventOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The specific event that the recording activity aims to record. This event may be a natural phenomenon, the movement of an individual etc."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EventOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/trajecto> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#EventOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Event of Interest"@en .
