# 
# http://w3id.org/trajecto#Interaction
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#Interaction> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#Interaction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#Abstract> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#Interaction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Something a moving entity does with, or near, an entity of interest during a trajectory. Specialized as POI interactions in the POI module."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#Interaction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/trajecto> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#Interaction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Interaction"@en .
# 
