<http://w3id.org/trajecto#ModeOfTransportation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The means by which a trajectory part is travelled, such as walking, cycling or bus."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#ModeOfTransportation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/trajecto> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#ModeOfTransportation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Mode of Transportation"@en .
# 
# http://w3id.org/trajecto#NavigationStyle
