<http://w3id.org/trajecto#NavigationStyle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Deprecated: navigation styles are modeled as movement patterns in the patterns module (patterns:TargetedSegment, patterns:CasualMovement, patterns:ExploratoryMovement, patterns:ImmersiveMovement) and asserted with patterns:exhibitsPattern."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#NavigationStyle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/trajecto> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#NavigationStyle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Navigation Style"@en .
