# 
# http://w3id.org/trajecto#ObjectOfInterest
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#ObjectOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
