<http://w3id.org/trajecto#ObjectOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The specific physical object that the recording activity aims to record. The object of interest may be a tree, a monument, a person etc."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#ObjectOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/trajecto> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#ObjectOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Object of Interest"@en .
