<http://w3id.org/trajecto#Person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A person whose movement is recorded as one or more trajectories."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#Person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/trajecto> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto#Person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Person"@en .
# 
